                  "type": "p"
                }
              ],
              "id": "2508208801"
            },
            {
              "content": [
                {
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "text": "Calculate the moles of HClO and ClO"
                    },
                    {
                      "sup": true,
                      "text": "–"
                    },
                    {
                      "text": " after reaction. Use the total volume to determine the concentrations of each. Recognize the type of solution that has been created and use the appropriate equation to calculate pH."
